note contract 5 abstract, lines 140-143: the full preserving table rotr rotl and or xor when listed.
note stdout oracle exp/a5-allops.out (python3).
om2
abstract dup32 ulong ops rotr rotl and or xor
holds dup32 dup32
fn dup32mk x uint to dup32
ret seal dup32 or shl ulong x 32 ulong x
end
fn main to int
d = dup32mk 0x89abcdef
e = dup32mk 0x0f0f00ff
puth open rotl d 8
puth open rotl d 40
puth open and d e
puth open or d e
puth open xor d e
puth open rotr d 5
ret 0
end
